Package: PriorRhythm
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Hierarchical Priors for Cardiac Safety Pharmacology
Version: 0.0.0.73
Authors@R: c(
    person("Richard", "Virgen-Slane",
           email = "Richard.Virgen-Slane@pfizer.com",
           role  = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Dean Dingzhou", "Li",
           role  = "aut")
  )
Description: Implements Bayesian hierarchical models for cardiac safety
    pharmacology data analysis in support of studies conducted within the
    context of ICH S7B/E14 guidance. Builds informative priors from
    historical study data to improve statistical power in new studies,
    reducing animal use in alignment with 3Rs principles. Provides
    quantitative probability statements for treatment effects on
    cardiovascular endpoints (QTc, heart rate, blood pressure, and left
    ventricular pressure), supporting quantitative assessment of
    cardiovascular safety pharmacology data and evaluation of historical
    data borrowing approaches within a New Alternative Method (NAM)
    framework.
